data: {"id": "3bf889154400412e-final", "run_id": "3bf889154400412e", "seq": 1243, "ts_ms": 1789106817137, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | 集群节点 CPU 资源不足（Insufficient cpu）导致 Pod 持续调度失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | K8s Pod Status | `status: Pending` | 直接展示 Pod 处于等待调度状态。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | FailedScheduling | `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found` | 明确指出集群 3 个节点均缺少可用 CPU 资源，且无优先级可抢占，判定为根因。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Resource Request | `container \"app\" requests CPU: 100k` | 确认 Pod 向调度器提交的调度需求为 100m CPU。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus Status | `kube_pod_status_phase` 值为 `1` (Pending), 样本数: 1 | 佐证当前 Pod 生命周期状态，因样本不足未展示趋势。 |\n\n**证据说明**：Kubernetes 事件（证据 2）直接指明了 `Insufficient cpu` 是导致调度失败的物理原因，这与 Pod 状态为 `Pending`（证据 1、4）及明确的资源请求（证据 3）构成了完整且无冲突的证据链。因容器未启动，Logging 和 Tracing 维度无数据产生，但不影响调度维度的根因判定。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n集群节点可用 CPU 不足 → 默认调度器拒绝绑定 Pod → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态 → 应用服务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为**集群节点 CPU 资源不足**。\n调度器事件明确指出当前集群的 3 个可用节点均无法满足 Pod 的 CPU 需求（100k），且在无优先级抢占的情况下无法进行调度（证据 2）。该事实直接导致 Pod 停留在 Pending 状态（证据 1），并阻断了后续容器启动与业务日志的产生。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 46.6s\n├─ 问题定位: 15.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 24.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v01/workload: 24.4s (Evidence 20.8s, RCA 3.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v01/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 46.63, "metrics": {"run_id": "3bf889154400412e", "mttr": {"value": "46.6s", "seconds": 46.626039028167725, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 46626.039028167725, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 43637.94541358948, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6925.230979919434, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2724.429130554199}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15500.551700592041, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 24438.940048217773, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 6663.278341293335, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

